.nh
.\" disable justification (adjust text to left margin only)
.ad l
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
imv-dir \- Open \*(Aqimv\*(Aq for all images in a directory
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fIimv\-dir\fR is a wrapper for \fIimv\fR that auto\-selects the directory where the image is located, so that the \fBnext\fR and \fBprevious\fR commands function in the same way as other image viewers\&.
.sp
Note that this wrapper supports only a single image\&. For opening multiple images, use plain imv\&.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fIimv\-dir\fR path
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.sp
imv is written and maintained by Harry Jeffery <me@harry\&.pm> with contributions from other developers\&.
.sp
Full source code and other information can be found at https://sr\&.ht/~exec64/imv\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBimv\fR(1)
